stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> draft: drafter opens changeset<br/>(records base_rev)
    draft --> draft: append / edit / reorder changes<br/>checks run live
    draft --> discarded: drafter discards
    draft --> submitted: drafter submits<br/>(checks re-run)
    submitted --> draft: drafter withdraws
    submitted --> rejected: approver rejects
    rejected --> draft: drafter revises
    submitted --> approved: approver approves<br/>(may be own changeset)
    approved --> conflict: newer revision touched<br/>the same nodes
    conflict --> draft: drafter rebases<br/>(checks re-run)
    approved --> published: approver publishes<br/>atomic → TREE_REVISION r+1
    published --> [*]
    discarded --> [*]

    note left of published
        publish is blocked only by structural errors:
        cycle, deprecated or foreign parent,
        deprecate with children,
        non-machine-safe label, stale base_rev.
        WoRMS issues are warnings.
    end note
